<title>ITALY: Air Dolomiti starts Pisa-Barcelona service.</title>
<headline>Air Dolomiti starts Pisa-Barcelona service.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Dolomiti said it has launched a daily ATR 42 return flight -- excluding Saturdays - - between Pisa and Barcelona.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
